# Local dev credentials (docs/architecture/repositories.md: "no secrets, ever" -
# local values live in gitignored files, the repository carries .example files only).
.env
docker/.env
k8s/overlays/local/.env

# `14-07`/ago-root `adr/0070`: the author's personal VLESS relay config (Xray-core client JSON,
# including the connection UUID) - a second file rather than a line in the .env above, deliberately
# not named ".env" so the top wildcard doesn't quietly cover it; named explicitly here instead. See
# k8s/overlays/demo/.env.telegram-relay.example for what it holds and why it is a separate Secret.
k8s/overlays/demo/.env.telegram-relay
